    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_02",
      "hash64": "189337532AA45135",
      "text": "Man, you sure did give me a beating in that\\nAcademy Ace Tournament![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_03",
      "hash64": "189336532AA44F82",
      "text": "Seems like all my closest buddies are in another\\nleague, you know?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_04",
      "hash64": "189331532AA44703",
      "text": "I mean, look at you—you just up and became\\na Champion! In your first year, to boot!\\c\\nYou know that’s pretty amazing, right?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_05",
      "hash64": "189330532AA44550",
      "text": "Then there’s Nemona—top marks in every class\\nat school, and she’s Champion-ranked too.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_06",
      "hash64": "189333532AA44A69",
      "text": "And I hear Penny’s got some kind of offer to\\nwork for the Pokémon League or something?![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_07",
      "hash64": "189332532AA448B6",
      "text": "I seem to be the only average one around here.\\nNothing special about me...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_select_01",
      "hash64": "707EFA59D26EA02B",
      "text": "You’re great at cooking!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_select_02",
      "hash64": "707EFB59D26EA1DE",
      "text": "Your [VAR 0x1107(00FF,0303)]momdad’s super famous!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1107",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_a_08a",
      "hash64": "668C3A517546AB32",
      "text": "Nah, I mean...it’s just, like, a hobby really.\\c\\nI only learned how to do the basics because my\\n[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0303)]momdad wasn’t around to cook for me...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1107",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303"
